      "structure_description": "The discrete Ce4 arsenotungstate macroanion comprises two identical [As3W29O103Ce2(pydc)(H2O)3]19− subunits joined by four Ce–O–C bonds in a staggered arrangement. Each subunit contains an As3W29 building block, two Ce(III) centers and a pydc ligand. K+ ions link the macroanions into a three-dimensional structure.",
